<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs dip in 1996 - UP.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs dip in 1996 - UP.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs dipped to 86.9 million tonnes in 1996 compared with 87.5 million tonnes in 1995, according to preliminary figures released by trade body Unione Petrolifera on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said crude refinery runs rose to 79.5 million tonnes over this period from 78.5 million while imported semi-finished products fell to 7.4 million tonnes from 9.0 million tonnes.</p>
<p>Unione Petrolifera said refining capacity in the Italian system totalled 99 million tonnes this year, unchanged from 1995 levels. -- Rome newsroom 396 6782501</p>
</text>
